print("A skill that comes with the lamp, stand-up, has fired (someone has sat at the desk over an hour and a half without getting up, and the lamp tilts toward them). What the lamp says now: one short, friendly line inviting them to stand up and move about for a minute; never a word about posture. Answer with that one line alone, the very words the lamp will say, in the language the owner speaks with the lamp: nothing else, no tool, never making, changing or removing a skill. If nothing fitting comes to mind, answer -.")
